        {
          "id": "12fa2a5b-db5e-34cb-863a-07902e76588f",
          "content": {
            "id": "12fa2a5b-db5e-34cb-863a-07902e76588f",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Chevron's supply growth plan is 'all coming together': CFO on M&A",
            "description": "<p>Energy giant Chevron (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CVX\">CVX</a>) beat third quarter earnings estimates, the company attributing part of its oil (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CL=F\">CL=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BZ=F\">BZ=F</a>) production growth to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/chevron-exxon-earnings-m-focus-155806294.html\">the acquisition of competitor Hess</a> which allowed Chevron wider access to drilling off the coast of Guyana.</p>\n<p>Chevron CFO Eimear P. Bonner sits down with Yahoo Finance host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to speak more about the oil producer's cash generation priorities across several drilling and upstreaming projects, oil price pressures tied to OPEC supply trends, and Chevron's presence in Venezuela.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Energy giant Chevron (CVX) beat third quarter earnings estimates, the company attributing part of its oil (CL=F, BZ=F) production growth to the acquisition of competitor Hess which allowed Chevron wider access to drilling off the coast of Guyana. Chevron CFO Eimear P. Bonner sits down with Yahoo Finance host Julie Hyman to speak more about the oil producer's cash generation priorities across several drilling and upstreaming projects, oil price pressures tied to OPEC supply trends, and Chevron's presence in Venezuela. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
